{"op":"add","path":"/elements/narrative","value":{"type":"TextBlock","props":{"variant":"body","content":"Net new MRR trended rising across Jan–Dec 2024, with an OLS slope of 7351.7483 per month (p = 2.73e-14). The series peaked at $224,600.00 in December 2024; by December 2024 it stood at $224,600.00, or 0% from that peak. Late-half months ran 1.3× the early-half median (early span: 2024-01-2024-06; late span: 2024-07-2024-12), reflecting acceleration through the year. Gross adds came 85.1% from new-customer acquisition and 14.9% from expansion; churn absorbed 8.8% of gross adds. Cumulative net new MRR compounded at 189988.1119 per month (p = 1.03e-13). Analysis covers 12 months across 3 plans; each monthly aggregate combines all plan-level rows with uniform weighting."},"children":[]}}
